        {
            "name": "Disable auto-updates",
            "description": "Stops the Google Play Store from silently updating Peacock back to the official version and wiping out the patch (which would bring the ads back). Works by setting the patched build's version number far ahead of anything on the Store, so it's treated as already up to date. You can still update deliberately by re-patching a newer APK in Morphe. Recommended to leave ON. Does not apply to mount-installed apps.",
